  program as it stands in this repository, use the metadata at the top level.
type: software
title: Raven One SimuLink
abstract: >-
  Raven One SimuLink is the C# Windows Forms program that Mert Torun wrote in
  2021 for his Bachelor's thesis "Password- / Keyless authentication" at
  TH Köln, to demonstrate RSA and MD5. The repository holds the source files
  printed in the appendix of the thesis, with files written in 2026 around
  them, and the deposited thesis as the version of record.
